[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0056","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0148","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 ActiveX 控件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Media Player 7.0 中的 WMP ActiveX 控件存在 Frame Domain Verification 漏洞变种，远程攻击者可诱导用户访问特制网页，通过 JavaScript URL 在 Internet Explorer 中绕过域验证机制并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0 及关联系统组件，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0148"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02","updated":"2001-06-02","remediation":"建议升级到 Windows Media Player 7.1 或更高版本，微软已通过安全公告 MS01-015 修复此漏洞。对于仍使用 Windows Media Player 7.0 的系统，可在 Internet Explorer 中禁用 WMP ActiveX 控件的 kill bit 或提高 Internet 区域安全级别以限制活动脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0000.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6227","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20528"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0056.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0056.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0410","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0410.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1349","title":"Sendmail Sendmail 信号处理器竞争条件漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.11.4 之前版本及 8.12.0.Beta10 之前版本中存在信号处理程序条件竞争漏洞。本地攻击者利用该漏洞可触发竞态条件，导致堆内存损坏和拒绝服务，并可能进一步实现本地权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需本地用户权限，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1349"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05.740","remediation":"建议升级 Sendmail 至 8.11.4 及以上版本，或 8.12.0.Beta10 及以上版本。该漏洞为信号处理程序中的条件竞争，攻击者需本地登录系统，因此可限制非授信用户对 sendmail 二进制文件的执行权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/sendmail/2001-q2/0001.html","http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_sm8120.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-106.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6633.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/187127","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2794","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2001/CVE-2001-1349.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1349","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e7775058398ca808720ec1cde94e510312238d06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1349.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1349.md","https://github.com/gipi/cve-cemetery/blob/47218f87ad9bacb0889d7280c151100354ca29c2/CVE-2001-1349/README.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/sendmail_header.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/nislab/threat-knowledge-graph/blob/8c04b3ea5fdf2c05a8f9866d95a35111f7844c16/preprocess/database_preprocessing.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0410.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0361","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1028","title":"Unix man 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-1028是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1028"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:26.490","remediation":"立即将 man 命令升级到 1.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ultimate_source 函数中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时限制本地用户对 man 命令的执行权限，通过 chmod 移除普通用户的 sudo 权限或使用 PAM 模块进行访问控制。同时检查系统中是否存在恶意构造的 man 页面文件，删除或隔离来源不明的 man 手册文件以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8622.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-072.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/793f2c91613b22189bf70b3322444954a50a3773/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1028","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1028.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/10de5f989525302a3452d86be5a85058aa88a086/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1028.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/40e5791b176b832cb09323d3962abe2fe3249e34/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m7q-cgwx-wx4v/GHSA-8m7q-cgwx-wx4v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1028.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1028.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--14eb8252-dbeb-442f-b80b-8f6e2550ddc4.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0405","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1323","title":"MIT Kerberos krb5 FTP 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 5（krb5）1.2.2 及更早版本中的 radix_encode 函数在处理 ftpglob 函数返回的文件通配符输出时，未能正确校验 base-64 编码数据的长度边界，导致发生缓冲区溢出（CWE-120）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 base-64 编码数据包触发该漏洞，进而使目标 Kerberos 服务崩溃拒绝服务，严重情况下可被利用执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 Kerberos 的各类 Linux 系统，包括 Red Hat Linux 7.0 至 7.2、Mandrake Linux 8.1 至 8.2 以及 MandrakeSoft Multi Network Firewall 2.0 等发行版，攻击条件宽松，无需身份验证且无需用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1323"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02.623","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2.3 或更高版本，并重新编译 ftpd。如暂无法立即升级，可下载并应用 MIT 2001 年 4 月发布的 ftpbuf_122_patch.txt 补丁后重新编译 ftpd；同时在 ftpd 配置中禁用匿名 FTP 登录作为临时缓解措施，限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-022-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98826223517788&w=2","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/ftpbuf.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-060.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/562a69670cdcc145f6e21df0324d598ba02be73f/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1323","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aab9feabdc7192f1040b6d0a4deb6b961232c23a/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1323.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f662aefd57cf19d7b12805142827e1495046a606/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cwm9-wqpm-mx67/GHSA-cwm9-wqpm-mx67.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1323.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88034/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2bf9d329-bc34-41e1-a682-191d26ed6180.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0408","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1333","title":"CUPS pstopdf 临时文件符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"` prefix that seems to have been accidentally included in the field value.\n\nWait, looking more carefully at the TOML:\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\n标签之间\n\n要求：\n...\n```\n\nThe description starts with \"标签之间\" which seems like leftover template text. The actual description content starts after that. But the quality checker says it's empty, which is strange.\n\nActually wait - looking at the TOML more carefully, I see:\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\n标签之间\n\n要求：\n- 中文\n- ≥50字\n- 涵盖原理、影响范围、攻击条件、利用方式\n- 改写为流畅中文，不编造\n\n让我组织描述：\n\nCVE-2001-1333 是 Linux CUPS...\n```\n\nSo the description field contains a lot of template/instruction text that shouldn't be there. The actual description content is mixed with instructions. The quality checker likely sees this as invalid or the actual description is considered empty because of the formatting issues.\n\nActually, re-reading the task more carefully - the user says \"description 字段为空\" but the field clearly has content. The issue might be that the content includes the template instructions mixed in, making it invalid.\n\nBut wait - the user's task says \"请修复 [description] 字段\" and \"只输出 <value>...\n","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1333"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03.757","remediation":"tags as specified.<value>立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.6 或更高版本以修复临时文件符号链接漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可临时限制 /var/spool/cups 目录权限为 700，防止本地用户利用符号链接攻击覆盖文件。各发行版用户应分别应用 SUSE-SA:2002:005、MDKSA-2001:048、CLA-2001:384 或 CLA-2001:386 官方安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000384","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000386","http://lists2.suse.com/archive/suse-security-announce/2001-Mar/0000.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-048.php3","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2008/CVE-2008-5377.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1333","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/333d3943ba23bf18333ea9f9256241d1bb61356e/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1333.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12664c75fe6d00113fe15964cee65a90965e367a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvch-hcwr-7gw3/GHSA-gvch-hcwr-7gw3.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2008-5377.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2008-5377","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-048.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0407","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1332","title":"Linux CUPS 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Linux CUPS（Common UNIX Printing System）1.1.6 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。漏洞原理在于打印服务对输入数据长度校验不足，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向网络可达的 CUPS 服务发送特制请求或数据，触发缓冲区溢出并可能执行任意代码。影响范围覆盖运行存在漏洞版本 CUPS 的 Linux 系统（如当时的 SuSE、Mandrake、Conectiva 等发行版），攻击条件为服务对外开放且攻击者可网络访问目标。CVSS 评分为 7.5（高危），可导致机密性、完整性与可用性受损。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1332"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03.623","remediation":"将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.6 或更高版本（如发行版提供的 cups 安全更新包）；无法立即升级时，在防火墙限制 631 端口仅允许受信内网访问，或临时停止 cupsd 服务并关闭对外打印共享。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000384","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000386","http://lists2.suse.com/archive/suse-security-announce/2001-Mar/0000.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-048.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b3647aa8630e92d52def237a668e1c7c212a696/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1332","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/035716a784b26bf707cbf0b8f17696c9c2e71cb8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1332.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fcbf67340ce1edbb3b64d6d36eabe3c12bd2904b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1332.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jgj6-r3rj-29cw/GHSA-jgj6-r3rj-29cw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1332.md","https://git