nux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-019 更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 gnuserv 端口（默认 TCP 端口）的远程访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0030.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-019.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-010.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-011.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6056","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0191","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0191.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0191.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5w94-q2g4-prcg/GHSA-5w94-q2g4-prcg.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0191.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-019.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0144","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0144.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0324","title":"Microsoft Windows 98/2000 Java Applet UDP Socket 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 98/2000 的 Java 客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，触发 Java Applet 打开大量 UDP Socket，耗尽系统可用 UDP 连接资源，导致目标主机无法建立新的 UDP 连接，严重时可能造成系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 98 及 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低，攻击者需诱使用户执行恶意 Applet 方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0324"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:06.033","remediation":"微软未针对此漏洞发布官方安全更新（Windows 98/2000 均已停止支持）。建议在 Internet Explorer 中禁用 Java Applet 执行（工具 → Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别 → 禁用 Java 小程序脚本），或在网络边界防火墙上限制单个源 IP 的并发 UDP 连接数（如 iptables 设置 connlimit 模块限制 UDP 连接不超过 10 个）。根本解决方案是升级到受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11），并安装最新安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2001-q1/0060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2340","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20613","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0324.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0324","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0324.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0324.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8xw9-37wm-wvjw/GHSA-8xw9-37wm-wvjw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0324.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3af425ae-e716-4b65-8999-71c34018880a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0144.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0142","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0142.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0319","title":"IBM Net.Commerce SQL 注入漏洞","description":"IBM Net.Commerce 2.0/3.x/4.x 及 IBM Websphere Commerce Suite 4.1.1 及更早版本的 orderdspc.d2w 宏中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 report 功能的 order_rn 参数中插入恶意 SQL 查询语句，绕过认证执行任意数据库操作，导致敏感数据泄露或数据篡改。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0319"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:05.483","remediation":"IBM Net.Commerce 系列（2.0/3.x/4.x）及 WebSphere Commerce Suite 4.1.1 及更早版本已停止维护，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即升级至 IBM 当前支持的 WebSphere Commerce 版本，或迁移至现代电子商务平台。如无法升级，应在 Web 服务器或应用层对 order_rn 参数实施严格的输入过滤，禁止包含 SQL 关键字和特殊字符，并限制 report 功能仅授权用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0072.html","http://www-4.ibm.com/software/webservers/commerce/netcomletter.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2350","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6067","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20618","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0319.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0319","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0319.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0319.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/netcommerce_sql.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9cwj-6gfj-h53r/GHSA-9cwj-6gfj-h53r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0142.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0140","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0316","title":"Linux 内核 sysctl() 内存读取漏洞 (CVE-2001-0316)","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.x 和 2.4.x 版本的 sysctl 系统调用在处理负数参数时存在边界检查缺陷，本地攻击者可通过向 sysctl 传递负数参数越界读取内核内存，泄露敏感信息并可能进一步提权。该漏洞影响 Linux 2.2.x 和 2.4.x 系列内核，攻击者需具备本地用户权限并能调用 sysctl 系统调用，通过构造负数参数触发内核内存越界读取，获取内核内存中的敏感数据（如指针、凭据等），进而结合其他技术实现权限提升。CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击/低复杂度/无需认证/部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0316"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:05.137","remediation":"升级到 Linux 内核 2.4.6 或更高版本，并应用安全补丁 RHSA-2001-013。修改 `/proc/sys` 目录下的系统调用参数验证逻辑，禁止 sysctl() 函数接受负值参数。实施临时缓解措施：限制本地用户权限，加强内核内存访问控制，并禁用不必要的 sysctl 服务以防止本地提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0267.html","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-009.0.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/6017","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-013.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2364","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6079","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20626","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0316.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0316","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0316.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0316.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h36r-qvg6-h4vh/GHSA-h36r-qvg6-h4vh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0316.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9bea150a-1b3a-4d14-8126-029689822475.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/CVE_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0138","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0308","title":"Bajie HTTP JServer 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Bajie WebServer 0.78及0.90版本中的UploadServlet存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者可通过调用该servlet上传恶意程序文件，然后利用路径遍历（..）方式访问已上传的文件，从而在服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞源于对文件上传后的路径访问控制不足，允许攻击者绕过限制访问上传目录之外的文件。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可完全控制受影响服务器。CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0308"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:04.273","remediation":"升级至 Bajie HTTP JServer 0.80 或更高版本。如无法升级，应立即禁用 UploadServlet 或限制其仅允许特定来源 IP 访问；同时配置 Web 服务器对上传目录禁止脚本执行权限，并实施严格的输入验证防止路径遍历攻击。作为更深层缓解，建议在反向代理层面拦截对 /servlet/UploadServlet 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0314.html","http://www.geocities.com/gzhangx/websrv/docs/security.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2388","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20638","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0308.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0308.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0308","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0308.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mhx9-m787-mwx3/GHSA-mhx9-m787-mwx3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0308.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2388/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_